<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Anixter said raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Anixter said raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential Securities upgraded Anixter International Inc to buy from hold, a Prudential source said.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- The stock rose 1/4 to 13-1/2.</p>
</text>
